{
  "id": "uniswap/swap",
  "card": {
    "sell-token": {
      "kind": "contract",
      "registryKind": "token",
      "names": [
        "usdc",
        "usdt"
      ]
    },
    "buy-token": {
      "kind": "contract",
      "registryKind": "token",
      "names": [
        "usdc",
        "usdt"
      ]
    },
    "sell-amount": {
      "kind": "amount",
      "of": "sell-token"
    },
    "min-buy": {
      "kind": "amount",
      "of": "buy-token",
      "floor": {
        "sells": "sell-amount"
      }
    }
  },
  "calls": [
    {
      "to": {
        "contract": "universal-router-2.1.2"
      },
      "value": {
        "const": "0"
      },
      "function": "execute(bytes commands, bytes[] inputs, uint256 deadline)",
      "args": {
        "commands": {
          "const": "0x1004"
        },
        "inputs": {
          "items": [
            {
              "encoded": {
                "as": "V4_SWAP(bytes actions, bytes[] params)",
                "args": {
                  "actions": {
                    "const": "0x0b060e"
                  },
                  "params": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "encoded": {
                          "as": "SETTLE(address currency, uint256 amount, bool payerIsUser)",
                          "args": {
                            "currency": {
                              "card": "sell-token"
                            },
                            "amount": {
                              "card": "sell-amount"
                            },
                            "payerIsUser": {
                              "const": "true"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "encoded": {
                          "as": "SWAP_EXACT_IN_SINGLE(((address currency0, address currency1, uint24 fee, int24 tickSpacing, address hooks) poolKey, bool zeroForOne, uint128 amountIn, uint128 amountOutMinimum, uint256 minHopPriceX36, bytes hookData) params)",
                          "args": {
                            "params": {
                              "fields": {
                                "poolKey": {
                                  "fields": {
                                    "currency0": {
                                      "contract": "usdc"
                                    },
                                    "currency1": {
                                      "contract": "usdt"
                                    },
                                    "fee": {
                                      "const": "8388608"
                                    },
                                    "tickSpacing": {
                                      "const": "1"
                                    },
                                    "hooks": {
                                      "contract": "uniswap-stable-pair-hook"
                                    }
                                  }
                                },
                                "zeroForOne": {
                                  "free": {
                                    "en": "Which way the swap runs in the pool: true sells USDC (currency0) for USDT, false sells USDT. The wrong direction leaves the Safe's settled sell token unspent and the bought token unpaid, so the router reverts or the effects check fails; it moves nothing else.",
                                    "zh-TW": "交換在池子裡的方向：true 是賣 USDC（currency0）換 USDT，false 是賣 USDT。方向錯了，Safe 已付的賣出代幣不會被用掉、買入代幣也付不出來，所以 router 會 revert，或交易後的效果檢查不通過；它不會動到別的東西。"
                                  }
                                },
                                "amountIn": {
                                  "card": "sell-amount"
                                },
                                "amountOutMinimum": {
                                  "atLeast": "card.min-buy"
                                },
                                "minHopPriceX36": {
                                  "free": {
                                    "en": "An optional price floor for this one pool, scaled by 10^36; the app sends 0, which checks nothing. Any other value can only make the swap revert, never pay less: the minimum to receive is bound separately.",
                                    "zh-TW": "這個池子單獨的可選價格下限，以 10^36 縮放；app 送出 0，也就是不檢查。任何其他值只會讓交換 revert，不會讓你收到更少：最少收到的數量另外綁定。"
                                  }
                                },
                                "hookData": {
                                  "const": "0x"
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "encoded": {
                          "as": "TAKE(address currency, address recipient, uint256 amount)",
                          "args": {
                            "currency": {
                              "card": "buy-token"
                            },
                            "recipient": {
                              "safe": true
                            },
                            "amount": {
                              "const": "0"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "encoded": {
                "as": "SWEEP(address token, address recipient, uint160 amountMin)",
                "args": {
                  "token": {
                    "card": "buy-token"
                  },
                  "recipient": {
                    "safe": true
                  },
                  "amountMin": {
                    "const": "0"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "deadline": {
          "withinSeconds": 1800
        }
      },
      "trailer": {
        "maxBytes": 46,
        "why": {
          "en": "The Uniswap app appends a short tag (starting 0x756e6978, 'unix') after execute's arguments; the Universal Router never reads calldata past its arguments (its registry entry's ignoresTrailer).",
          "zh-TW": "Uniswap app 會在 execute 的引數後面附上一段短標記（開頭是 0x756e6978，即 'unix'）；Universal Router 從不讀引數之後的 calldata（見它登記項目的 ignoresTrailer）。"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "effects": {
    "gives": [
      {
        "token": "card.sell-token",
        "amount": "card.sell-amount"
      }
    ],
    "gets": [
      {
        "token": "card.buy-token",
        "amount": {
          "atLeast": "card.min-buy"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
